{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_18","type":"agent_message","text":"The generated code reveals the main opportunity: standard `tl.sin`/`tl.cos` expands into two full OCML range-reduction paths per angle. Since these angles are finite FP32 values, I’m testing the native CDNA sine/cosine instructions with an explicit turns-based range reduction; I’ll compare numerics locally before putting it through a verification attempt."}}
