{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_40","type":"agent_message","text":"The native instructions remain accurate even without explicit reduction through the model’s full 131,072-position context range, and removing it saves about 0.15 µs. I also found that 13 of 16 workloads have token counts exactly divisible by the workgroup tile, so I’m specializing away their load/store masks before the next full verification."}}
